# GuessWatts - Concept Validation

> **Note (2026-10-21):** this is the original concept. Two things were built differently: the result
> compares with the market in Estimado and shows "Poupas" in Preciso, never "Perdes €X/ano" (ADR-028,
> superseding ADR-011), and the data refresh is weekly, with the ERSE date on the page (ADR-027).
> `docs/DECISIONS.mdc` says what is built.

## Mission

Break consumer inertia in the Portuguese energy market. Help people realize they're losing money and make switching effortless.

> The problem isn't information. It's inertia. GuessWatts's job is to break it.

---

## Feature List (Prioritized)

### Phase 1 - Core (MVP Refinement)

| # | Feature | Purpose | Effort |
|---|---------|---------|--------|
| 1.1 | **Simplified input (€/mês)** | Lower barrier, instant engagement | Small |
| 1.2 | **Loss-focused result ("Perdes €X/ano")** | Emotional trigger, wake-up call | Small |
| 1.3 | **Single best offer highlight** | Clear answer, no paralysis | Small |
| 1.4 | **Switching script** | Actionable steps, reduce friction | Small |
