### Phase 2 - Retention & Distribution

| # | Feature | Purpose | Effort |
|---|---------|---------|--------|
| 2.1 | **Personal URL with state** | Stateless "account", return visits | Small |
| 2.2 | **Calendar reminder export** | Self-managed alerts, zero backend | Small |
| 2.3 | **Comparison on return** | Show improvement opportunity | Medium |
| 2.4 | **Share card** | Organic distribution, ENDORSE | Medium |

### Phase 3 - Refinement

| # | Feature | Purpose | Effort |
|---|---------|---------|--------|
| 3.1 | **Human-readable power selector** | Replace jargon with context | Small |
| 3.2 | **PDF refinement flow** | Precision after initial estimate | Done |
| 3.3 | **Mobile optimization** | Broader reach | Medium |
| 3.4 | **"Verificar novamente" prompt** | Seasonal nudge | Small |

### Intentionally Not Doing

| Feature | Reason |
|---------|--------|
| User accounts | Overengineered, privacy concerns |
| Email backend | Maintenance burden, GDPR |
| Operadora integrations | Political complexity, low ROI |
| Native app | Web sufficient for occasional use |
| Price history charts | Nobody returns for graphs |
| B2B segment | Different product entirely |

