### Key Insight

The market is **designed for switching**:
- No fidelização by default
- CPE (delivery point code) is the only key needed
- Switch takes one phone call (~5 minutes)

Yet 80%+ of consumers stay with the same provider for years.

**The gap isn't information. It's inertia.**

