## LOVE Framework Analysis

### L - LEARN

*"How do people discover this exists?"*

| Before (v1) | After (v2) |
|-------------|------------|
| ❌ No distribution | ✅ Share cards with shock value |
| ❌ SEO only | ✅ "Descobre quanto perdes por ano" |
| ❌ Passive | ✅ Viral loop built-in |

**Triggers:**
- Friend shares result
- Social media card
- News about energy prices
- Moving house
- Received shocking bill

---

### O - ONBOARD

*"How fast to value?"*

| Before (v1) | After (v2) |
|-------------|------------|
| ⚠️ 4 fields minimum | ✅ 1 field (€/mês) |
| ⚠️ Technical jargon | ✅ Human language |
| ⚠️ ~30 seconds | ✅ ~5 seconds to value |

**Flow:**
```
"Quanto pagas?" → €95 → "Perdes €288/ano" → 5 seconds
```

**Refinement (optional):**
```
Upload PDF → Precise calculation → Same loss framing
```

---

### V - VALUE

*"What's the aha moment?"*

| Before (v1) | After (v2) |
|-------------|------------|
| ⚠️ "Best offer is €71" | ✅ "You're LOSING €288/year" |
| ⚠️ Information | ✅ Emotion + Action |
| ⚠️ List of options | ✅ Single clear answer |

**Value Equation:**
```
           Perceived savings × Ease of action
Value  =  ─────────────────────────────────────
                   Effort to discover
```

**Key insight:** Loss framing is 2x more motivating than gain framing.
- "Save €288" < "Stop losing €288"

---

### E - ENDORSE

*"Why would someone share this?"*

| Before (v1) | After (v2) |
|-------------|------------|
| ❌ Nothing to share | ✅ Shareable result card |
| ❌ No social proof | ✅ "Descobri que perdia €288/ano" |
| ❌ Utility only | ✅ Conversation starter |

**Share motivations:**
- Help friends save money (altruism)
- "Look what I discovered" (social currency)
- Outrage at current provider (venting)

**Share mechanics:**
- One-click copy link
- Pre-generated card with personal result
- WhatsApp/Twitter/Facebook optimized

