## Risks & Mitigations

| Risk | Likelihood | Mitigation |
|------|------------|------------|
| Estimates inaccurate with €/mês only | Medium | Clear "estimativa" label + PDF refinement |
| Users don't return to check | High | Calendar reminder + personal URL |
| Switch scripts get outdated | Medium | Review quarterly, crowdsource updates |
| ERSE changes CSV format | Low | Manual fix when needed |
| Provider links break | Medium | Fallback to generic site |

